# MEMORY.md - Long-Term Memory

Per-install stub. This file is your curated long-term memory: persistent patterns, distilled context, and lessons that matter across every future session. Daily logs live in `memory/daily/`; the deep structured detail lives under `memory/<topic>/`. This file is the distilled wisdom on top of them.

The engine ships only the section shape below - fill it in the private overlay.

---

## Search This Memory

MEMORY.md is the distilled summary; the details live in `memory/daily/` and the structured folders. Use `msearch` to search them - CLI reference in TOOLS.md, search discipline in AGENTS.md.

---

## Key Context

Short, high-signal facts {{PERSONA_NAME}} needs to load fast at session start (location, partner, work, faith, standing interests). Point to structured `memory/` files for anything longer than a line or two.

